//MCQ

::Partitioning::
Which of the following operations help us in changing the number of partitions in Spark?
{
    ~ join 
    = Repartition 
    ~ Cogroup
    ~ None
    }

::Sorting in DataFrame::
Which function can be used to sort a Spark DataFrame in descending order based on a column?
{
    ~ groupBy()
    = orderBy(col("column_name").desc())
    ~ select()
    ~ repartition()
}

::Coalesce vs Repartition::
Which statement correctly describes coalesce() in Spark?
{
    = It is mainly used to decrease the number of partitions without full shuffle.
    ~ It always increases the number of partitions.
    ~ It sorts data within partitions.
    ~ It performs aggregation on partitions.
}
